{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Carnage has a total of 3.68 QUINTILLION unique builds. Yes you read that right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Astronauts with unique abilities and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different ships each with unique stats and starting weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 ship modifications</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ run upgrades\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440650/extras/5d5f951238446283a6cfc4ba3a6b6a8b.webp?t=1769796024\" width=316 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440650/extras/9b72222f3f8b652d58a985d3907bb79c.poster.avif?t=1769796024\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440650/extras/9b72222f3f8b652d58a985d3907bb79c.webm?t=1769796024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440650/extras/9b72222f3f8b652d58a985d3907bb79c.mp4?t=1769796024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle endless waves of alien spaceships. Fight against a variety of enemies with different behaviours and attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440650/extras/91a5b90286e515ef0538e778406b482e.webp?t=1769796024\" width=293 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440650/extras/730bcb9c87231d5c46dda020155bb301.poster.avif?t=1769796024\" width=600 height=